<mxCell id="inv" value="&lt;b&gt;Invariants&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• No transition to ROUTING without passing VERIFIED (auth is never bypassed, even on ID&amp;A outage).&lt;br&gt;• Every terminal state emits exactly one audit event carrying the correlation-id.&lt;br&gt;• REJECTED vs FAILED distinguishes user error (4xx) from platform error (5xx) for alerting.&lt;br&gt;• VERIFYING has a hard 2 s deadline; ROUTING+RENDERING share the remaining budget of the 8 s total." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#FB8C00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacing=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="770" width="1200" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
